<http://www.essepuntato.it/2008/12/pattern#contains> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                                     rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasPart>.
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2008/12/pattern#isContainedBy> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                                          rdfs:subPropertyOf <http://purl.org/dc/terms/isPartOf>.
<http://www.essepuntato.it/2008/12/pattern#isContainedByAsHeader> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>.
